# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace @YOUR_LOGIN.
# Mirrors the tiers: the last matching line wins, and a pattern with no owner
# means nobody's approval is required by CODEOWNERS.
#
# 1. Default: everything needs a code owner (matches the T2 default).
*                 @YOUR_LOGIN

# 2. T0 and T1 paths from factory-tiers.yml: unowned, so the App's approval counts.
/docs/reference/
/docs/evidence/
/scripts/
/src/
/skills/

# 3. T2 paths inside those folders go back to the owner. Keep these last.
/scripts/lint_*.py   @YOUR_LOGIN
/scripts/guard_*.py  @YOUR_LOGIN
/.github/            @YOUR_LOGIN
CLAUDE.md            @YOUR_LOGIN
AGENTS.md            @YOUR_LOGIN
